<title>FINLAND: Kemira signs 7-year DEM 825 mln credit.</title>
<headline>Kemira signs 7-year DEM 825 mln credit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals and fertiliser group Kemira Oy said in a statement on Friday it had signed a seven-year multi-currency revolving credit facility valued at DEM 825 million.</p>
<p>Part of the loan would be used to repay a similar DEM 350 million arrangement agreed last year, it said.</p>
</text>
